{"job_id":"F-bb0e4572b921d6629e09","family_id":"F-bb0e4572b921d6629e09","title":"수도방위사령부령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":8,"target_id":"bdb4e453944eda09042030ae605a9ca4fa4d4e32cb190f36936c37bea1edb86c","source_hash":"11b70cd98cb79c6cce21dd21753712c699019892e928e9f6da097a5b43586c65","text":"首都防御指挥命令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":120,"target_id":"b0ff7232ec71b64c2f735f4dfe91e94e603555d17ff46453198d1c22d0684322","source_hash":"51321fe71663f212c8b8bdd7869f5f019e77055e40dff7c196e183b5654a3077","text":"第一条（设立）在军队中设立首都防御司令部（以下简称“司令部”），负责保卫首都和特定安全区域（指国家元首所在位置附近为安全保护所必需的合理范围内的区域；下文同上）。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":120,"end":245,"target_id":"300c5dc6aca4cf8cf737321a18b7d9225aa9a0469751f090703da1282dc59b49","source_hash":"d8129d5e2cf4cd1bdc2ff4140db5d2c0b9414cd5f1ccbe43daa88f739f028a8e","text":"第二条（任务）本指挥部的任务如下：\n1. 首都防御\n2. 特定安全区域的安全性\n3. 在发生自然灾害或其他灾难时，为保护生命或财产提供必要的支持\n4. 为维护安全和秩序所必需采取的其他措施\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":245,"end":286,"target_id":"9a884ddb64faafc4ffdb0c75d3c117d69ad7c98e6183eeeff3bba6f0bc355170","source_hash":"8d5e8c19bfc71f70809710f2575bc9137c760b78d33cf479f637db74b3ba1be7","text":"第三条（管辖范围）指挥部的管辖范围为整个首都地区和特定安全区。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":286,"end":379,"target_id":"f68ef5643558f4dadc75a05e69a7ff4d457d2ff5f1304278fdbab70442dc970c","source_hash":"a7dd8bc55bef9b755b3e26e51bbd3023ee708faf997093bb98eab637bb9dcafc","text":"第四条（指挥官等的任命）\n①司令部应设司令、副司令及参谋长。\n② 司令官、副司令官和参谋长应由陆军将官担任。<2017年9月5日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":379,"end":677,"target_id":"366e61216c241dfe51d8edd89ff09b811ae27a428dbfe6067e7625f2bdda98d8","source_hash":"486c87cd61f4a8148bc23ceedd91dc80460e86ac7720e8807830914afb5ea4c0","text":"第五条（指挥官等的职责）\n① 除根据《武装部队组织法》第9条第3款规定，司令官须接受参谋长联席会议主席的作战指挥和监督的情况外，司令官应当按照陆军参谋长的命令，监督司令部事务，指挥和监督司令部下属或分配到司令部的部队。\n② 指挥官在开展与特定安全区域相关的行动时，应与总统安全局局长协商。<2008年2月29日、2013年3月23日、2017年7月26日修订>\n副指挥官协助指挥官，并在指挥官缺席时履行指挥官的职责。\n参谋长协助指挥官，协调、控制和监督参谋事务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":677,"end":789,"target_id":"36493c1762111beacd35730e1db6c1e0858819463bc657d9ddc7b45be9592c9a","source_hash":"b76f0affecb0bc215cef25eb4739682777321c24b270b3c1e920edc3669b5db0","text":"第六条（部门和单位的设立）\n①在总部建立必要的参谋部门和单位。\n② 第1款规定的参谋部门的设立和职责划分的事项，由陆军参谋长决定；部队的设立、任务和组织的事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":789,"end":965,"target_id":"567f5d9c163fdda8f43e644ce5bffa07fc1d3acf9f912bd425ee1c21069a0692","source_hash":"12308a9209dd62d0f00770e1b42102e31be2a26a18bb19276f62f4d3614ff3cd","text":"第七条（其他军事单位等的调配）  国防部长如认为为执行本司令部的任务所必需，可向本司令部调配海军、空军及警察部队。在此情况下，国防部长应就调配警察部队一事事先与内政安全部长协商。<2008年2月29日；2013年3月23日；2014年11月19日；2017年7月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":965,"end":1016,"target_id":"9c4458f33a9d804313ec7b69dcc05eb85c611a997f47244fea4497ae4f294b91","source_hash":"bbefdc1a546d4a5711b95b5ec276dfd98a7b396a46274376a4c3b7ad79c4f212","text":"第八条（武器的使用）所属部队的武器装备的使用由指挥官决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1016,"end":1059,"target_id":"b7f31f4f3f59a41f9444facb0483e05ec7dd5ef7e5eeecaf98891fbeb2978bb5","source_hash":"32a41646161c44c4f6d70a2ddae62ef6a423c7e1e64277d4e3123efc3173a183","text":"第九条（人员配额）驻扎在指挥部的军事人员和文职人员的人员配额由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1059,"end":1110,"target_id":"9508ce67dc5b6b867640b8fb709ba89c496c236506458ae9138df524d118a21f","source_hash":"62623e6f2e4a52af3fa1673b878ba249929d20a87110f0dc13fb45be1c43f097","text":"补充规定 <第13123号，1990年9月29日>\n\n本法令自1990年10月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1110,"end":1150,"target_id":"c188b86c91b124b345a146082b46373b3eabf69a8619a5212255af582e6ca678","source_hash":"3bbd35c4552b6d9a751dd31a67a7e638a8e58da2002dde925a7799c92d23d115","text":"增编（国防部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第20675号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1150,"end":1179,"target_id":"0c205db993179dee7601fd0ae602ec2b3d84355fa70fded807f3b5012db2e353","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1179,"end":1193,"target_id":"36c281d20d51e1851c6f823a70dc839b744657e475f3a1b320299918cccc5206","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1193,"end":1296,"target_id":"3f8ea71837b3cba9fe7e5838e8a1c775def1abfdb7dab7e55df88633e11f8b26","source_hash":"d7ca5e6a554bdbe038523642df8e2920ff26afde602b172ecd300a58e50ba270","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<21> 已省略\n\n  <22> 首都防御指挥令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第五条第二款中的“总统安全局局长”应改为“总统办公厅主任”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1296,"end":1355,"target_id":"e0e637ef7f19fbb3e31b79d22dfdb35580872f308bf3976051684a726623b2d1","source_hash":"289b4d1fe8faba4167948f357dd36759e9f25e7ffcc5a165165dfebf251fbbc1","text":"  在第7条后半部分，“内政部长”应改为“公共管理和安全部长”。\n\n  <23> 至 <30> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1355,"end":1401,"target_id":"c3987afc3a0d83692d42db4f9008e2713615ba9b235154b133dc6dd34ac39f02","source_hash":"0dd84bf0289586832492e3d03993ef07c486aac023d0a6aa88e36bee8b21fcf3","text":"增补文件（总统安全法实施令等）<第20732号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1401,"end":1430,"target_id":"e687333c09b2ab17712d1282607500f890ea6f3a3d1f2706e9b7d518a59541b1","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1430,"end":1531,"target_id":"3aa771fe3b813c5c54ccf8dd339b93424c068a771c498a341e52424738dae149","source_hash":"0ec25d071de345cc3a649052f8cfee66dac7d2e3892cee09a5c4b5e91840e7b2","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至④ 省略\n\n  ⑤ 对《首都防御司令部法令》的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第五条第二款中的“总统安全局局长”应改为“总统安全局局长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1531,"end":1539,"target_id":"c4c5a6c361437b7304bb472948f2fb80bf2289fb87a9328253033c5d7183a919","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1539,"end":1579,"target_id":"5fc8b7e22c138c4678cf19a6d3b86309326e1af9136ffa650c31ae4a93aee4bb","source_hash":"ff6f25ff86490fda66dcfbd21c8fbf51192d7fdbb2370dc7d7477d407e53d397","text":"增编（国防部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日，第24413号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1579,"end":1608,"target_id":"e7c87ec499711c775904e1042dd87601a4efbfdd9312e7b3925157b86fdcff5b","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1608,"end":1616,"target_id":"436c202ed14f801c68c074c32dc510374b16d6c7aa794838923673e11b6751df","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"条款 2 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1616,"end":1721,"target_id":"2b463da3526538a204c73177ccaeb0ada38a9c77567bdc96d85203709fc33543","source_hash":"aa67fea741583916132993695fb59700717e1fd03e4a11c8b0fd6bb9c0f77eaf","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<22>款省略\n\n  <23> 首都防御指挥令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第五条第二款中的“总统安全局局长”应改为“总统安全局局长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1721,"end":1780,"target_id":"6900d577480fba890d7933ca6083d4899be9d2f45a1098ee4d2066b5d96f97b6","source_hash":"9b9fc5545f1c99e0dab8494d7dc2c1ea730c5088ab5b91739a2e7ac0fa3a889f","text":"  第七条后半部分，“公共行政和安全部长”应改为“安全保障部长”。\n\n  <24> 至 <32> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1780,"end":1823,"target_id":"df6a16942105cfcddb03152bcdf8f3668a835d85a2c0f4dbe172e0312201ca4f","source_hash":"a3c47358b5319a3ba45787da785dfea890df8d8d79398cc9047d30e04f9d9dac","text":"增编（政府行政和内政部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2014年11月19日第25751号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1823,"end":1948,"target_id":"4f58136ef0edc45520ba899b8bb8728e32f744d807c005a2f8a24ecce2361302","source_hash":"ecc5937743f918230a397055273a1cd44275217a8341699c9b3693e458eb6e4c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第五条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1948,"end":1965,"target_id":"0a35e4d445bd9218c21f368daaec853e149066a197044ea716b0523b7f976d35","source_hash":"6ffda08faf109c176be482db4409396ced46b0373db22ad766c9b45cca3b755a","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1965,"end":2029,"target_id":"e5d247a1a9757386d5524c978cbad35607abd311734cc2686d36814fa92f1278","source_hash":"4588711dc316f60f3563cf785c090f21d77b92a41e5307b2361ec572fcef3213","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<93>款已省略\n\n  <94> 首都防御指挥令部分内容修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2029,"end":2089,"target_id":"96970491fe7063418c562053d202674a1135467d726bfecd4e9b17bbcfa0d764","source_hash":"15c7e003cbecee3ed9e5ebfde65606a99874cef75dfec946bc60c59341869e1a","text":"  在第7条后半部分，“安全与公共管理部长”应改为“政府行政与内政部长”。\n\n  <95> 至 <418> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2089,"end":2131,"target_id":"78121b6bdfb2144b04fbb8e216664671bd6f1aa27515e2dd343244f9fa0a9c56","source_hash":"2229ee61688f381fa8791a317dce02e692966c0fc8dfff0224bc44e3cd9315a8","text":"增编（内政安全部及其附属机构组织结构）<第28211号，2017年7月26日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2131,"end":2256,"target_id":"3977411a7e244d83a1b28313c3bc839e12dd2477b324d4cda6acfc48b6655b8b","source_hash":"e322c6bccc7dc02efb62fdad6a23702463436edc72b2f2f5029c536f3946505e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，根据补充法令第八条修正的总统令中，修正在本法令生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的总统令的部分，应自相关总统令各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2256,"end":2273,"target_id":"54fd3cd904e199e7f185c1220374cba5c2d21d84302009322963dc5812583b43","source_hash":"d9985315e81c5ba7d5516a248b6bd3f949098433ce3c6da60edc74f7499d0a05","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2273,"end":2376,"target_id":"a08d6d6c404dff436cea470e6bdc70f2b46f183f6a649bd67e0e66f8fc40c29d","source_hash":"b7ed9a479d4f15878ef1f634234910ced17f271a4a27a8be9f4683564f684e7b","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至<85>款省略\n\n  <86> 首都防御指挥令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第五条第二款中的“总统安全局局长”应改为“总统安全局局长”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2376,"end":2436,"target_id":"e77056becf2bc17975667335e931a2476c07829322e99cdbad74335ede10185b","source_hash":"9c774e1925e726e5477f831dd4a8dfa914bf3f8dd2c2972989c5602dd6b7db13","text":"  第七条后半部分，“政府行政和内政部长”应改为“公共行政和安全部长”。\n\n  <87> 至 <388> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2436,"end":2469,"target_id":"5eb82d24439b708146d8aa117e6cfed8f1ad4ec3420598ac8cf013ea674957d9","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充规定（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2469,"end":2506,"target_id":"3f9fc6d9d86e12aa60d99d960f3cf0c03b3262a5539725276f6b093cadba4b70","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00038","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2506,"end":2520,"target_id":"ae8d0d83dda30c60d378c382df4ca9799fbe8bfed3eb3c0c8335d839792462e2","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"条款 2 和 3 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-004003-197272-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2520,"end":2638,"target_id":"6cb04d374008b41290fad9017a1bee8c1786374429f06065731e97c934f52027","source_hash":"78032ddc9fe9a1ac46399804ef91304cfb4a173d76aa81171929efd5cd368904","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<52>款已省略\n\n  <53> 首都防御指挥令部分内容修订如下。\n\n  第 4 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <54> 至 <90> 已省略"}]}